ine-flex flex-shrink flex-row items-center\"><span class=\"text-muted-foreground text-xs mt-0.5\">前广州设计周文化有限公司</span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class=\"flex items-center mt-2\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;white-space:pre-wrap\" class=\"text-foreground flex-1 break-all text-sm font-semibold leading-relaxed flex-1 break-all text-sm font-semibold leading-relaxed\">这工作OK吗？</div></div><div><div class=\"relative line-clamp-none whitespace-pre-wrap break-words cursor-pointer text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground mt-1\" style=\"overflow:hidden;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;-webkit-line-clamp:2\" role=\"button\"><span><span>大佬们!求助!!!选择哪个啊</span><span class=\"block\"></span><span>都是社群运营</span><span class=\"block\"></span><span>职位1:C端用户 试用期7K转正在看能力谈双休五险一金最低基数试用期6个月</span><span class=\"block\"></span><span>职位2:经销商社群+线下沙龙策划试用期</span><span class=\"block\"></span><span>6.5K+(500-1000绩效)+200全勤转正7K-7.5K+(500-2000绩效)+200全勤大小周 五险最低基数(绩效无论是试用期或者是转正两个月没有拿到85% 扣底薪500或者开除)试用期3个月</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-3.5 flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-start \"><div class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-center *:hover:fill-primary *:hover:text-primary\"><svg version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"*:hover:fill-primary mr-1 size-4 fill-mm-gray-600\" viewBox=\"0 0 15.75 12.6\" fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><path d=\"M7.875,8.6625L6.3,8.6625C3.66716,8.6615,1.25078,10.1202,0.0252012,12.4504C0.00829857,12.2382,-0.000108147,12.0254,0.00000112653,11.8125C0.00000112653,7.46314,3.52564,3.9375,7.875,3.9375L7.875,0L15.75,6.3L7.875,12.6L7.875,8.6625Z\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">分享</span></div><div class=\"mx-6 flex cursor-pointer items-center *:hover:fill-primary *:hover:text-primary sm:mx-12\"><svg version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"*:hover:fill-primary mr-2 size-3.5 fill-mm-gray-600\" viewBox=\"0 0 13.3 12\" fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><path d=\"M8.74201e-7,3.99601C-0.00147692,1.7869,1.7909,-0.0036823,4,0.00000635783L9.33333,0.00000635783C11.542,0.00000635783,13.3333,1.79667,13.3333,3.99601L13.3333,12L4,12C1.79133,12,8.74201e-7,10.2033,8.74201e-7,8.00401L8.74201e-7,3.99601ZM8,5.33334L8,6.66667L9.33333,6.66667L9.33333,5.33334L8,5.33334ZM4,5.33334L4,6.66667L5.33333,6.66667L5.33333,5.33334L4,5.33334Z\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">评论</span></div><div class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-center  *:hover:fill-primary *:hover:text-primary\"><svg version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"*:hover:fill-primary mr-2 size-3.5 fill-mm-gray-600\" viewBox=\"0 0 13.59 13\" fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><path d=\"M0,6.0801L0,11.9785C0,12.5429,0.457121,13,1.02149,13L1.94107,13L1.94107,5.06832L1.02149,5.05862C0.457335,5.05862,0,5.51595,0,6.0801ZM12.0298,3.98666L7.96856,4.01238C8.15927,3.34126,8.25584,2.74487,8.25584,2.21981C8.25584,1.02848,7.21203,-0.138102,6.16968,0.0133008C5.25058,0.146749,5.14965,0.94113,5.14965,1.93641L5.14965,2.83513C5.14965,3.9886,4.18154,4.97127,3.05912,5.07948L2.9116,5.07803L2.9116,13L10.9117,13C11.6601,13,12.3028,12.4678,12.4422,11.7325L13.5603,5.83407C13.7419,4.87468,13.0062,3.98666,12.0298,3.98666Z\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">赞</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm mx-0 my-4 border-mm-gray-200 p-3 dark:border-mm-gray-700 sm:mx-6 sm:my-0 sm:rounded-none sm:border-x-0 sm:border-t-0 sm:px-0 sm:pb-4 sm:pt-6 sm:shadow-none\"><div><div class=\"flex flex-1 justify-between\"><div class=\"flex flex-1 items-center\"><div class=\"flex flex-1 items-center\"><div class=\"relative inline-block cursor-pointer\" role=\"button\"><span class=\"relative flex shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full border size-9\"><span class=\"flex h-full w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-muted\"></span></span></div><div class=\"ml-1.5 flex-1 cursor-pointer \"><div class=\"flex items-center\"><div><div class=\"relative whitespace-pre-wrap break-words line-clamp-1 flex items-center text-sm font-semibold leading-none\" role=\"button\"><span class=\"inline-flex flex-shrink flex-row items-center\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm\">杨帆</span></span></div></div></div><div><div class=\"relative whitespace-pre-wrap break-words line-clamp-1 flex items-center leading-none text-muted-foreground\" role=\"button\"><span style=\"color:#6E727A;font-size:12px\" class=\"inline-flex flex-shrink flex-row items-center\"><span class=\"text-muted-foreground text-xs mt-0.5\">泉州信息工程学院</span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class=\"flex items-center mt-2\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;white-space:pre-wrap\" class=\"text-foreground flex-1 break-all text-sm font-semibold leading-relaxed flex-1 break-all text-sm font-semibold leading-relaxed\">想问问大家Anker和跨越哪个更好一点？</div></div><div><div class=\"relative line-clamp-none whitespace-pre-wrap break-words cursor-pointer text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground mt-1\" style=\"overflow:hidden;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;-webkit-line-clamp:2\" role=\"button\"><span><span>家人们，秋招到了选择困难症犯了，目前在安克和跨越这俩offer之间反复横跳，真的不知道怎么选，想听听大家的建议🙏</span><span class=\"block\"></span><span>💼先给大家说说安克，跨境电商龙头，A股上市公司，在出海消费电子领域那可是头部企业。成立14年，业务一直保持两位数增长率，产品远销140多个国家和地区，全球超2亿用户，真的很牛。这次秋招岗位覆盖超广，算法、研发、销售、营销啥都有，还好多不限专业，感觉机会超多，而且据说薪资福利在行业里也很能打。</span><span class=\"block\"></span><span>📦再讲讲跨越，物流行业里也很有知名度，发展速度挺快的，覆盖的业务范围很广，国内外都有布局。听已经入职的学长学姐说，公司氛围不错，团队协作也很融洽，晋升空间也还可以。</span><span class=\"block\"></span><span>🤔现在纠结的点在于：</span><span class=\"block\"></span><span>🎯行业发展上，消费电子和物流哪个更有潜力呢？安克做消费电子，产品更新换代快，竞争也激烈；跨越所在的物流行业，感觉是刚需，但也在面临数字化转型这些挑战。</span><span class=\"block\"></span><span>🎯职业发展来看，安克岗位多能接触到不同业务，但感觉竞争也大；跨越岗位更聚焦物流环节，会不会发展路径更清晰呢？</span><span class=\"block\"></span><span>🎯工作体验方面，有没有在这两家公司工作过的朋友，工作强度、加班情况、企业文化这些到底怎么样啊？</span><span class=\"block\"></span><span>真的太纠结了，家人们帮我出出主意吧，或者有了解这两家公司的，也欢迎分享下内部情况🙏内推🐎 H44YU37</span><span class=\"block\"></span><span>#秋招 #offer选择 #安克创新 ￼￼秋招选哪个好啊？</span></span></div></div><div class=\"inline-grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 mt-2\"><div class=\"relative size-32 cursor-pointer overflow-hidden rounded-md border\" role=\"button\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent\" src=\"https://i9.taou.com/maimai/p/37875/4405_84_4dSGy7FFOzpYrxRn?imageView2/0/w/1080/h/360\"/></div><div class=\"relative size-32 cursor-pointer overflow-hidden rounded-md border\" role=\"button\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent\" src=\"https://i9.taou.com/maimai/p/37875/4406_84_5hOrfHrcN5gWR557?imageView2/0/w/1080/h/360\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-3.5 flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-start \"><div class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-center *:hover:fill-primary *:hover:text-primary\"><svg version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"*:hover:fill-primary mr-1 size-4 fill-mm-gray-600\" viewBox=\"0 0 15.75 12.6\" fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><path d=\"M7.875,8.6625L6.3,8.6625C3.66716,8.6615,1.25078,10.1202,0.0252012,12.4504C0.00829857,12.2382,-0.000108147,12.0254,0.00000112653,11.8125C0.00000112653,7.46314,3.52564,3.9375,7.875,3.9375L7.875,0L15.75,6.3L7.875,12.6L7.875,8.6625Z\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">1</span></div><div class=\"mx-6 flex cursor-pointer items-center *:hover:fill-primary *:hover:text-primary sm:mx-12\"><svg version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/sv