enter rounded-full bg-muted\"></span></span></div><div class=\"ml-1.5 flex-1 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"flex items-center\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:1;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;white-space:pre-wrap\" class=\"text-foreground text-sm font-extrabold text-sm font-extrabold \">乖巧的小鹿在看脉脉</div></div><div class=\"mt-0.5 flex items-center\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:1;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;white-space:pre-wrap\" class=\"right-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground right-1 text-xs  text-muted-foreground\">2小时前·推荐算法·5年+</div></div></div></div></div><div><div class=\"flex items-center mt-2\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;white-space:pre-wrap\" class=\"text-foreground flex-1 break-all text-sm font-semibold leading-relaxed flex-1 break-all text-sm font-semibold leading-relaxed\">Offer选择</div></div><div><div class=\"relative line-clamp-none whitespace-pre-wrap break-words cursor-pointer text-sm leading-relaxed mt-1\" style=\"overflow:hidden;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;-webkit-line-clamp:2\" role=\"button\"><span><span>硕五搜推广算法</span><span class=\"block\"></span><span>微信小店和快手，总包差不多，算上签字费快手还多个3到4万</span><span class=\"block\"></span><span>微信小店，职级t9要换base去广州,业务比较新，机会和风险并存</span><span class=\"block\"></span><span>快手边缘业务留杭州,职级e9</span><span class=\"block\"></span><span>女朋友在杭州，有必要为了微信title和业务机会去寻求有可能的发展吗？</span><span class=\"block\"></span><span>另外微信t9职级也比快手e9职级低，有点担心以后跳出来，职级会不会不好要，或者被质疑</span><span class=\"block\"></span><span>评论也能点赞投票，感觉更真实？投票器投出来的似乎全都有微信选微信？</span></span></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-muted p-3 mt-2\"><div class=\"mb-2 cursor-pointer text-sm font-bold\">Offer选择</div><div class=\"relative mt-2 flex items-center overflow-hidden rounded-lg border bg-background px-2.5 py-2 text-sm\"><div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-1  justify-between\"><div class=\"flex items-center \"><div class=\"mr-1 flex-shrink\">微信</div></div></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 top-0 bg-mm-blue-100 transition-[width]  duration-1000 \" style=\"width:0\"></div></div><div class=\"relative mt-2 flex items-center overflow-hidden rounded-lg border bg-background px-2.5 py-2 text-sm\"><div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-1  justify-between\"><div class=\"flex items-center \"><div class=\"mr-1 flex-shrink\">快手</div></div></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 top-0 bg-mm-blue-100 transition-[width]  duration-1000 \" style=\"width:0\"></div></div><div class=\"relative mt-2 flex items-center overflow-hidden rounded-lg border bg-background px-2.5 py-2 text-sm\"><div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-1  justify-between\"><div class=\"flex items-center \"><div class=\"mr-1 flex-shrink\">下面评论点赞也能投票</div></div></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 top-0 bg-mm-blue-100 transition-[width]  duration-1000 \" style=\"width:0\"></div></div><div class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">58人参与</div></div></div><div class=\"mt-3.5 flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-start \"><div class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-center *:hover:fill-primary *:hover:text-primary\"><svg version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"*:hover:fill-primary mr-1 size-4 fill-mm-gray-600\" viewBox=\"0 0 15.75 12.6\" fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><path d=\"M7.875,8.6625L6.3,8.6625C3.66716,8.6615,1.25078,10.1202,0.0252012,12.4504C0.00829857,12.2382,-0.000108147,12.0254,0.00000112653,11.8125C0.00000112653,7.46314,3.52564,3.9375,7.875,3.9375L7.875,0L15.75,6.3L7.875,12.6L7.875,8.6625Z\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">1</span></div><div class=\"mx-6 flex cursor-pointer items-center *:hover:fill-primary *:hover:text-primary sm:mx-12\"><svg version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"*:hover:fill-primary mr-2 size-3.5 fill-mm-gray-600\" 